.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt X509_STORE_NEW 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm X509_STORE_new ,
.Nm X509_STORE_up_ref ,
.Nm X509_STORE_free ,
.Nm X509_STORE_lock ,
.Nm X509_STORE_unlock
.Nd X509_STORE allocation, freeing and locking functions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/x509_vfy.h
.Ft X509_STORE *
.Fo X509_STORE_new
.Fa void
.Fc
.Ft void
.Fo X509_STORE_free
.Fa "X509_STORE *xs"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo X509_STORE_lock
.Fa "X509_STORE *xs"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo X509_STORE_unlock
.Fa "X509_STORE *xs"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo X509_STORE_up_ref
.Fa "X509_STORE *xs"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn X509_STORE_new
function returns a new X509_STORE.
.Pp
.Fn X509_STORE_up_ref
increments the reference count associated with the X509_STORE object.
.Pp
.Fn X509_STORE_lock
locks the store from modification by other threads,
.Fn X509_STORE_unlock
unlocks it.
.Pp
.Fn X509_STORE_free
frees up a single X509_STORE object.
If the argument is NULL, nothing is done.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn X509_STORE_new
returns a newly created X509_STORE or NULL if the call fails.
.Pp
.Fn X509_STORE_up_ref ,
.Fn X509_STORE_lock
and
.Fn X509_STORE_unlock
return 1 for success and 0 for failure.
.Pp
.Fn X509_STORE_free
does not return values.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr X509_STORE_set_verify_cb_func 3
.Xr X509_STORE_get0_param 3
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Fn X509_STORE_up_ref ,
.Fn X509_STORE_lock
and
.Fn X509_STORE_unlock
functions were added in OpenSSL 1.1.0.
